OL,3,ASurge in Anthropic shares eases after
OL,4,Atrading started with AI firm valued
OL,5,Aclose to $2tn
OL,6,
OL,7,FAI firm Anthropic is being listed
OL,8,Fpublicly for the first time on Thursday
OL,9,Fon the Nasdaq stock market in New York
OL,11,FThe company's share price started at
OL,12,F$111.50, which at that stage gave it a
OL,13,Fmarket value close to $2tn - prices
OL,14,Fhave since dropped back slightly to
OL,15,Fnearer $100 a share
OL,17,FThat's still a steep jump from the $83
OL,18,Fset last night - take a closer look at
OL,19,Fsome of the numbers here
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
