OL,3,ASurge in Anthropic shares eases after
OL,4,Atrading started with AI firm valued
OL,5,Aclose to $2tn
OL,6,
OL,7,FAnthropic, the company behind AI
OL,8,Fchatbot Claude, raised a record $81bn
OL,9,Fahead of its stock market debut
OL,11,FThe seven founders who set up Anthropic
OL,12,Fin 2021 have now become
OL,13,Fmulti-billionaires - we've looked at
OL,14,Fwhy private companies decide to sell
OL,15,Fshares publicly here
